<title>UK: SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>British Open squash championship on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 8-Brett Martin (Australia) 15-10</p>
<p>15-11 13-15 15-12</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>1-Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat 5-Liz Irving (Australia)</p>
<p>9-1 9-3 9-2</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat 6-Jonathon Power (Canada) 15-13</p>
<p>5-15 9-15 15-12 15-11</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>4-Sue Wright (England) beat 11-Linda Charman (England) 9-7 9-5</p>
<p>9-4</p>
</text>
